## 11. Comparison to Closed Frameworks

| Aspect | Closed Framework | GFF-1 |
|:---|:---|:---|
| Ground | Axiom (chosen) | Observation (found) |
| Fidelity | Absolute (binary) | Purpose-relative (continuous) |
| Ideal | Claimed as attainable | Approached, never reached |
| Loss | Footnote or ignored | Structural and necessary |
| Chain | Declared | Derived under purpose-pressure |
| Correction | Resisted or constrained | Invited and structurally required |
| Pursuit | Terminated at completion | Continues perpetually |
| Status | Complete, closed | Incomplete, open |
| Purpose | Internal consistency | Service to the ground |

